      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BISCUIT BOUND (6) started long odds on the back of a moderate debut but broke through for maiden success last time, scoring by 2.75 lengths at Warragul over 400m (22.65). Rates on top in this line up. JUST JEZEBEL (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (26.73) in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win at Warragul. Has a good record here including two wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Cannot be taken lightly. MILES LEE ROSE (3) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (25.40) at this track in a T3 RSTW over 435m. Expecting another good run. HURRY DUSTY (1) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a neck second (24.89) in a T3 RSTW at this track.",
